\", \"username\": \"BIA190820256747\"}','','','2025-10-16 09:13:26'),(11273,0,'admin','system','INSERT','students',597,NULL,'{\"name\": \"SINDEP DEBORAH LOHDIR\", \"matric_no\": \"VUGBNS216329\", \"username\": \"BIA230820252116\"}','','','2025-10-16 09:13:26'),(11274,0,'admin','system','INSERT','students',598,NULL,'{\"name\": \"UDOM ANIETIENTEABASI DANIELLE\", \"matric_no\": \"VUGBNS216354\", \"username\": \"BIA190820259038\"}','','','2025-10-16 09:13:26'),(11275,0,'admin','system','INSERT','students',599,NULL,'{\"name\": \"UDOYE AFOMA\", \"matric_no\": \"VUGBNS216355\", \"username\": \"BIA260820251259\"}','','','2025-10-16 09:13:26'),(11276,0,'admin','system','INSERT','students',600,NULL,'{\"name\": \"USMAN FELICIA ODUFA\", \"matric_no\": \"VUGBNS226595\", \"username\": \"BIA190820257489\"}','','','2025-10-16 09:13:26'),(11277,0,'admin','system','INSERT','students',601,NULL,'{\"name\": \"UYANNA CHIAMAKA MIRIAM\", \"matric_no\": \"VUGBNS226966\", \"username\": \"BIA190820250306\"}','','','2025-10-16 09:13:26'),(11278,0,'admin','system','INSERT','students',602,NULL,'{\"name\": \"UZU PERPETUAL CHIZOBA\", \"matric_no\": \"VUGBNS227018\", \"username\": \"BIA190820254100\"}','','','2025-10-16 09:13:26'),(11279,0,'admin','system','INSERT','students',603,NULL,'{\"name\": \"YUSUF KARIMAH OYARAZI\", \"matric_no\": \"VUGBNS226881\", \"username\": \"BIA250820250094\"}','','','2025-10-16 09:13:26'),(11280,0,'admin','system','INSERT','students',604,NULL,'{\"name\": \"TEST\", \"matric_no\": \"VUAICT101\", \"username\": \"VUAICT101\"}','','','2025-10-16 09:13:26'),(11281,0,'admin','system','INSERT','exams',42,NULL,'{\"name\": \"TESTING\", \"is_active\": 1}','','','2025-10-16 10:01:03'),(11282,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',476,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Greet and identify the patient by explaining the procedure to the patient to prepare their mind to gain informed consent\", \"score_values\": \"0\"}','','','2025-10-16 10:03:44'),(11283,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',477,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Ensure privacy by screening and switching off nearby fans to prevent contamination\", \"score_values\": \"0\"}','','','2025-10-16 10:03:44'),(11284,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',478,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Wash hands thoroughly, ensuring aseptic technique\", \"score_values\": \"0\"}','','','2025-10-16 10:03:44'),(11285,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',479,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Check the treatment sheet to confirm prescribed medication, lotion, and type dressing\", \"score_values\": \"0\"}','','','2025-10-16 10:03:45'),(11286,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',480,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Assemble and check the completeness and sterility of all required articles on a clean dressing trolley (e.g., dressing set, gloves, mask, antiseptic solution, sterile gauze, tape, apron, waste bin\", \"score_values\": \"0\"}','','','2025-10-16 10:03:45'),(11287,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',481,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Position the patient comfortably and expose only the area to be dressed by positioning the topmost clothes appropriately\", \"score_values\": \"0\"}','','','2025-10-16 10:03:45'),(11288,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',482,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Assess the wound for type, size, drainage, odor, color, and presence of bleeding or infection\", \"score_values\": \"0\"}','','','2025-10-16 10:03:45'),(11289,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',483,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Call for an assistant and instruct him/her to wash hands, put on a mask, and gloves\", \"score_values\": \"0\"}','','','2025-10-16 10:03:45'),(11290,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',484,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Don a mask and apron to maintain asepsis\", \"score_values\": \"0\"}','','','2025-10-16 10:03:45'),(11291,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',485,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Set the trolley at the patient’s bedside, ensuring the top shelf contains sterile items and the bottom for contaminated items\", \"score_values\": \"0\"}','','','2025-10-16 10:03:45'),(11292,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',486,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Ask the assistant to carefully remove the outer dressing and adhesive straps without contaminating the wound\", \"score_values\": \"0\"}','','','2025-10-16 10:03:45'),(11293,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',487,NULL,'{\"text\": \"The nurse inserts hands into the sterile pack, picks towel and dries hands using sterile towel\", \"score_values\": \"0\"}','','','2025-10-16 10:03:45'),(11294,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',488,NULL,'{\"text\": \"The nurse put on sterile gloves correctly, ensuring not to touch external surfaces to avoid contamination\", \"score_values\": \"0\"}','','','2025-10-16 10:03:45'),(11295,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',489,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Place sterile Mackintosh and towel under the area to protect bed linen\", \"score_values\": \"0\"}','','','2025-10-16 10:03:45'),(11296,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',490,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Pick dressing and dissecting forceps using sterile technique; arrange inner instruments properly on the sterile field\", \"score_values\": \"0\"}','','','2025-10-16 10:03:45'),(11297,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',491,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Using forceps, gently remove the old dressing from the wound and discard it into a kidney dish or waste bowl\", \"score_values\": \"0\"}','','','2025-10-16 10:03:45'),(11298,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',492,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Instruct assistant to pour antiseptic lotion (e.g., normal saline or povidone-iodine) into the gallipot without touching the container\", \"score_values\": \"0\"}','','','2025-10-16 10:03:45'),(11299,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',493,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Dip a sterile swab using dissecting forceps, transfer to dressing forceps aseptically to avoid contamination\", \"score_values\": \"0\"}','','','2025-10-16 10:03:45'),(11300,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',494,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Clean the wound from center outward in one stroke per swab; discard each used swab and repeat until clean\", \"score_values\": \"0\"}','','','2025-10-16 10:03:45'),(11301,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',495,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Dry wound with sterile dry swabs using the same aseptic technique\", \"score_values\": \"0\"}','','','2025-10-16 10:03:45'),(11302,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',496,NULL,'{\"text\": \"With sterile forceps, apply a sterile dressing or gauze large enough to cover the wound completely\", \"score_values\": \"0\"}','','','2025-10-16 10:03:45'),(11303,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',497,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Apply adhesive strapping or bandage lightly to secure the dressing\", \"score_values\": \"0\"}','','','2025-10-16 10:03:45'),(11304,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',498,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Remove gloves, dispose of waste properly, and clean the dressing trolley\", \"score_values\": \"0\"}','','','2025-10-16 10:03:45'),(11305,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',499,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Wash hands thoroughly after the procedure\", \"score_values\": \"0\"}','','','2025-10-16 10:03:45'),(11306,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',500,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Make the patient comfortable, adjust clothing and bed position, open windows, and remove screens\", \"score_values\": \"0\"}','','','2025-10-16 10:03:45'),(11307,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',501,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Observe for immediate post-procedure reactions such as pain, bleeding, dizziness and reassure the patient\", \"score_values\": \"0\"}','','','2025-10-16 10:03:45'),(11308,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',502,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Document the procedure appropriately\", \"score_values\": \"0\"}','','','2025-10-16 10:03:45'),(11309,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',503,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Report any abnormal findings such as pus, foul odor and bleeding promptly\", \"score_values\": \"0\"}','','','2025-10-16 10:03:45'),(11310,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',504,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Greet and identify the patient by explaining the procedure to the patient to prepare their mind to gain informed consent\", \"score_values\": \"0, 0.5, 1\"}','','','2025-10-16 10:07:56'),(11311,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',505,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Ensure privacy by screening and switching off nearby fans to prevent contamination\", \"score_values\": \"0, 0.5,1\"}','','','2025-10-16 10:07:56'),(11312,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',506,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Wash hands thoroughly, ensuring aseptic technique\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.25,0.5\"}','','','2025-10-16 10:07:56'),(11313,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',507,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Check the treatment sheet to confirm prescribed medication, lotion, and type dressing\", \"score_values\": \"0\"}','','','2025-10-16 10:07:56'),(11314,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',508,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Assemble and check the completeness and sterility of all required articles on a clean dressing trolley (e.g., dressing set, gloves, mask, antiseptic solution, sterile gauze, tape, apron, waste bin\", \"score_values\": \"0\"}','','','2025-10-16 10:07:56'),(11315,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',509,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Position the patient comfortably and expose only the area to be dressed by positioning the topmost clothes appropriately\", \"score_values\": \"0\"}','','','2025-10-16 10:07:56'),(11316,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',510,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Assess the wound for type, size, drainage, odor, color, and presence of bleeding or infection\", \"score_values\": \"0\"}','','','2025-10-16 10:07:56'),(11317,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',511,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Call for an assistant and instruct him/her to wash hands, put on a mask, and gloves\", \"score_values\": \"0\"}','','','2025-10-16 10:07:56'),(11318,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',512,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Don a mask and apron to maintain asepsis\", \"score_values\": \"0\"}','','','2025-10-16 10:07:56'),(11319,0,'admin','system','INSERT','quest