 mark\", \"score_values\": \"0, 0.25, 0.5\"}','','','2025-10-16 10:58:46'),(11410,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',604,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Ensure  Aseptic techniques 1mark\", \"score_values\": \"0, 0.5, 1\"}','','','2025-10-16 10:58:46'),(11411,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',605,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Strip the top sheet by placing a bath blanket over the sheet and remove the sheet from underneath the bath blanket, then fold neatly on the bed stripper. 1mark\", \"score_values\": \"0, 0.5, 1\"}','','','2025-10-16 10:58:46'),(11412,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',606,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Place the second bath blanket underneath the patient. 1mark\", \"score_values\": \"0, 0.5, 1\"}','','','2025-10-16 10:58:46'),(11413,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',607,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Gently remove the patient?s clothing. ?mark\", \"score_values\": \"0, 0.25, 0.5\"}','','','2025-10-16 10:58:46'),(11414,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',608,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Wash the pressure areas with soapy water, using a bath flannel, rinse thoroughly, dry, and apply barrier cream.( a. Back of the head. b. Elbows. c. Shoulders. d. Knees. e. Ankles. f. Heels. g. Buttocks   2 marks\", \"score_values\": \"0, 1, 2\"}','','','2025-10-16 10:58:46'),(11415,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',609,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Straighten the bottom sheet and remake the bed 1mark\", \"score_values\": \"0, 0.5, 1\"}','','','2025-10-16 10:58:46'),(11416,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',610,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Make patient comfortable, remove screen, turn on fan, and open window 1mark\", \"score_values\": \"0, 0.5, 1\"}','','','2025-10-16 10:58:46'),(11417,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',611,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Wash the equipment 1mark\", \"score_values\": \"0, 0.5, 1\"}','','','2025-10-16 10:58:46'),(11418,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',612,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Wash hands and dry ?mark\", \"score_values\": \"0, 0.25, 0.5\"}','','','2025-10-16 10:58:46'),(11419,0,