xt\": \"APPEARANCE  1Mark\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.5,1\"}','','','2026-03-04 10:59:57'),(24429,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',878,NULL,'{\"text\": \"COMPOSURE  1mark\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.5,1\"}','','','2026-03-04 10:59:57'),(24430,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',879,NULL,'{\"text\": \"GREET PATIENT, INTRODUCE YOURSELF AND OBTAIN CONSENT 1mark\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.5,1\"}','','','2026-03-04 10:59:57'),(24431,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',880,NULL,'{\"text\": \" Set tray, wheel to BED SIDE 1mark\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.5,1\"}','','','2026-03-04 10:59:57'),(24432,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',881,NULL,'{\"text\": \"START WITH PATIENT?S TEMPERATURE,  PULSE AND BLOOD PRESSURE, TAKING NOTE OF ALL THE VITAL INDICES THAT MUST BE NOTED LIKE PULSE RYTHYM, VOLUME, NOTE ALSO THE DYSTOLIC READING VERY WELL. 1mark \", \"score_values\": \"0,0.5,1\"}','','','2026-03-04 10:59:58'),(24433,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',882,NULL,'{\"text\": \"REASSURE and GIVE PATIENT A CHANCE TO ASK QUESTIONS AND EXPRESS HIS/HER FEARS. 1mark\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.5,1\"}','','','2026-03-04 10:59:58'),(24434,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',883,NULL,'{\"text\": \"IF THERE IS ANY DEVIATION FROM THE NORMAL RANGES, RECORD WITH A RED BIRO FOR ADEQUATE NOTICE AND ATTENTION. 1mark\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.5,1\"}','','','2026-03-04 10:59:58'),(24435,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',884,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Make patient comfortable 1mark\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.5,1\"}','','','2026-03-04 10:59:58'),(24436,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',885,NULL,'{\"text\": \"UNMASK AND DISCARD HAND GOVES, perform hand hygiene 1mark\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.5,1\"}','','','2026-03-04 10:59:58'),(24437,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',886,NULL,'{\"text\": \"DOCUMENT PROCEDURE ON THE APPROPRIATE CHART.1mark\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.5,1\"}','','','2026-03-04 10:59:58'),(24438,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',887,NULL,'{\"text\": \"ASSEMBLY THE INSTRUMENT 1/2\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.25,0.5\"}','','','2026-03-04 11:00:33'),(24439,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',888,NULL,'{\"text\": \"CLARIFY THE ORDER 1/2\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.25,0.5\"}','','','2026-03-04 11:00:33'),(24440,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',889,NULL,'{\"text\": \"INTRODUCE SELF AND PROCEDURE 1/2\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.25,0.5\"}','','','2026-03-04 11:00:33'),(24441,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',890,NULL,'{\"text\": \"MAINTAIN PRIVACY 1/2\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.25,0.5\"}','','','2026-03-04 11:00:33'),(24442,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',891,NULL,'{\"text\": \"WASH YOUR HANDS 1/2\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.25,0.5\"}','','','2026-03-04 11:00:33'),(24443,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',892,NULL,'{\"text\": \"WEAR YOUR GLOVE 1/2\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.25,0.5\"}','','','2026-03-04 11:00:33'),(24444,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',893,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Position the patient to expose the area and relieve pressure on it (e.g., side-lying). 1/2\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.25,0.5\"}','','','2026-03-04 11:00:33'),(24445,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',894,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Removal of Old Dressing 1\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.5,1\"}','','','2026-03-04 11:00:33'),(24446,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',895,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Gently remove the old dressing (using adhesive remover if necessary). Observe for drainage, odor, and color. 1/2\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.25,0.5\"}','','','2026-03-04 11:00:33'),(24447,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',896,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Skin Inspection 1\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.5,1\"}','','','2026-03-04 11:00:33'),(24448,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',897,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Assess the wound for staging (size, depth, exudate, slough, granulation). Note the condition of the surrounding skin (peri wound). 1/2\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.25,0.5\"}','','','2026-03-04 11:00:34'),(24449,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',898,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Cleanse the ulcer using 0.9% Normal Saline. Use gentle, direct irrigation or moist gauze. Do not scrub. 1/2\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.25,0.5\"}','','','2026-03-04 11:00:34'),(24450,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',899,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Apply a barrier cream to surrounding skin. Reposition the patient, ensuring the wound is not under direct pressure. 1/2\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.25,0.5\"}','','','2026-03-04 11:00:34'),(24451,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',900,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Ensure the patient is comfortable. 1/2\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.25,0.5\"}','','','2026-03-04 11:00:34'),(24452,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',901,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Turn patient every 2hours 1/2\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.25,0.5\"}','','','2026-03-04 11:00:34'),(24453,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',902,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Wash your hand and remove glove 1/2\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.25,0.5\"}','','','2026-03-04 11:00:34'),(24454,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',903,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Tidy your environment 1/2\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.25,0.5\"}','','','2026-03-04 11:00:34'),(24455,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',904,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Make Patient comfortable 1/2\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.25,0.5\"}','','','2026-03-04 11:00:34'),(24456,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',905,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Prepare Equipment:?Assemble linen (2 sheets, blanket, bedspread, pillowcase, mackintosh/drawsheet) on a clean trolley/chair in order of use. 1\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.5,1\"}','','','2026-03-04 11:01:27'),(24457,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',906,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Hand Hygiene & PPE:?Perform hand hygiene; put on gloves if handling soiled linen. 1\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.5,1\"}','','','2026-03-04 11:01:27'),(24458,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',907,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Position Bed:?Raise bed to a comfortable working height (waist level) and lock wheels. 1\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.5,1\"}','','','2026-03-04 11:01:27'),(24459,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',908,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Remove Soiled Linen:?Loosen old linen, remove, and roll inwards (soiled side inside). Place in hamper; do not shake or let it touch your uniform. 1\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.5,1\"}','','','2026-03-04 11:01:27'),(24460,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',909,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Clean Mattress:?If necessary, wipe mattress with disinfectant an1d allow to dry. 1\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.5,1\"}','','','2026-03-04 11:01:27'),(24461,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',910,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Draw Sheet:?Place in the middle of the bed (under patient\'s back/hips) and tuck on both sides. 1\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.5,1\"}','','','2026-03-04 11:01:27'),(24462,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',911,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Apply Top Linen:?Spread top sheet blanket, and spread. Tuck at the foot of the bed and miter corners. 1\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.5,1\"}','','','2026-03-04 11:01:27'),(24463,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',912,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Pillow & Finish:?Apply pillowcase. Place pillow with open end away from the door. 1\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.5,1\"}','','','2026-03-04 11:01:27'),(24464,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',913,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Lower the bed and ock its wheels to ensure patient safety 1\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.5,1\"}','','','2026-03-04 11:01:27'),(24465,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',914,NULL,'{\"text\": \"REMOVE GLOVES AND WASH HANDS  1\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.5,1\"}','','','2026-03-04 11:01:27'),(24466,0,'admin','system','UPDATE','exams',71,'{\"name\": \"QUESTION STATION 6\", \"is_active\": 1}','{\"name\": \"QUESTION STATION 6\", \"is_active\": 1}','','','2026-03-04 11:11:18'),(24467,7,'examiner','examiner4','ASSESSMENT_SUBMITTED','answers',8154,NULL,'{\"exam_id\": 67, \"student_id\": 557, \"question_id\": 877, \"score\": 0.50}','','','2026-03-04 11:30:50'),(24468,7,'examiner','examiner4','ASSESSMENT_SUBMITTED