e\": \"BONIFACE ONOYIMA\", \"matric_no\": \"VUG/ICT/01/001\", \"username\": \"VUG/ICT/01/001\"}','','','2026-04-17 14:52:42'),(32439,0,'admin','system','INSERT','exams',76,NULL,'{\"name\": \"TASTE\", \"is_active\": 1}','','','2026-04-17 14:55:31'),(32440,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',915,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Greets and introduces self to patient\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.125,0.25\"}','','','2026-04-17 14:57:06'),(32441,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',916,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Explain the procedure to the patient and obtains consent\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.125,0.25\"}','','','2026-04-17 14:57:06'),(32442,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',917,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Request for an assistant, provide privacy by screening the bed\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.25,0.5\"}','','','2026-04-17 14:57:06'),(32443,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',918,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Performs hand hygiene and wear gloves(clean)\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.25,0.5\"}','','','2026-04-17 14:57:06'),(32444,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',919,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Loosens edges of plaster of the old dressing, stabilizes the skin with one hand while pulling the plaster in the opposite direction\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.25,0.5\"}','','','2026-04-17 14:57:06'),(32445,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',920,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Beginning at the edges of the dressing, lifts the dressing towards the center of the wound\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.25,0.5\"}','','','2026-04-17 14:57:06'),(32446,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',921,NULL,'{\"text\": \"If the dressing sticks, moistens it with 0.9% normal saline before removing it\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.25,0.5\"}','','','2026-04-17 14:57:06'),(32447,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',922,NULL,'{\"text\": \"Observe remove dressing for drainage especially noting amount ,colour and odour\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.25,0.5\"}','','','2026-04-17 14:57:06'),(32448,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',923,NULL,'{\"text\":