s, remove gloves, wash hands, and tidy the bedside. 1 mark\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.5,1\"}','','','2026-04-23 09:37:05'),(32599,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',990,NULL,'{\"text\": \"21. Document the procedure \", \"score_values\": \"0,0.5,1\"}','','','2026-04-23 09:37:05'),(32600,0,'admin','system','INSERT','exams',81,NULL,'{\"name\": \"PROCEDURES ONE\", \"is_active\": 1}','','','2026-04-23 09:46:14'),(32601,0,'admin','system','INSERT','exams',82,NULL,'{\"name\": \"PROCEDURES THREE\", \"is_active\": 1}','','','2026-04-23 09:46:48'),(32602,0,'admin','system','INSERT','exams',83,NULL,'{\"name\": \"PROCEDURES FIVE\", \"is_active\": 1}','','','2026-04-23 09:47:19'),(32603,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',991,NULL,'{\"text\": \"1. Greets the patient ? mark\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.25,0.5\"}','','','2026-04-23 09:55:48'),(32604,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',992,NULL,'{\"text\": \"2. Explain the procedure to the patient. ? mark\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.25,0.5\"}','','','2026-04-23 09:55:48'),(32605,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',993,NULL,'{\"text\": \"3. Obtain informed consent. ? mark\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.25,0.5\"}','','','2026-04-23 09:55:49'),(32606,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',994,NULL,'{\"text\": \"4. Assemble required equipment 1 mark\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.5,1\"}','','','2026-04-23 09:55:49'),(32607,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',995,NULL,'{\"text\": \"5. Wash hands thoroughly using aseptic technique 1mark\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.5,1\"}','','','2026-04-23 09:55:49'),(32608,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',996,NULL,'{\"text\": \"6. Prepare the environment, ensure adequate lighting, ventilation, and privacy ? mark\", \"score_values\": \"0,0.25,0.5\"}','','','2026-04-23 09:55:49'),(32609,0,'admin','system','INSERT','questions',997,NULL,'{\"text\": \"7. Position the patient in a high Fowler?s or sitting position, with head flexed slightly forward to prevent entry into the trachea. 1 mark\",